-- RDX0127: an `over` whose selector is not a path — plan 88 leaf 3.
--
-- `(.cmp other)` opens with `.` and so reaches `over`'s dispatch, but it is a
-- method **application** rather than a selector: `section` rewinds and there is
-- no path to assign through. Reported against the selector, which is where the
-- author wrote the thing that cannot be a place.
--
-- An operator section — `over (+ 1) bump n` — cannot reach this diagnostic at
-- all, because the dispatch requires `(` then `.`, so that spelling parses as a
-- call to a function named `over`. The first version of this fixture used it
-- and **built successfully**, which is how the unreachable guard beside this
-- one was found and deleted.
bump : u32 -> u32
bump n = n + 1

shift : u32 -> u32
shift n =
  mut local = n
  over (.cmp 0) bump local
  local
